     ssnnttpp — reference Simple Network Time Protocol client

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ssnnttpp [--ffllaaggss] [--ffllaagg [_v_a_l_u_e]] [----ooppttiioonn--nnaammee[[=| ]_v_a_l_u_e]] [ host‐
